       "children": [],
       "classes": [],
       "element": "p",
       "innerHTML": "Every note has a <em>Visible to Apps</em> switch, and it starts off. Anything that wants a note's words has to go through a broker on your device: consent for each destination, access that expires, and a record of every disclosure. A tool that doesn't ask gets titles and dates, not your writing.",
       "mobileStyles": {
        "fontSize": "17px"
       },
       "tabletStyles": {}
      },
      {
       "attributes": {},
       "baseStyles": {
