        "margin": "0",
        "maxWidth": "680px"
       },
       "blockId": "5ef15fcc8b",
       "children": [],
       "classes": [],
       "element": "p",
       "innerHTML": "That is also the line for AI. Because the key already lives on your device, on-device features can work inside it. Anything that would send your words to a server would be a separate choice — explicit, and off unless you turn it on. AI features are on the roadmap, built to that rule.",
       "mobileStyles": {
        "fontSize": "17px"
       },
       "tabletStyles": {}
